[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0187","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0187.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0212","title":"Pragma Systems InterAccess TelnetD Server 4.0 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pragma Systems InterAccess TelnetD Server 4.0 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可向目标 TelnetD 服务发送特制的畸形终端客户端配置信息，导致服务进程崩溃，无法正常处理后续连接请求。该漏洞利用难度较低，无需身份认证即可触发，影响运行了 InterAccess TelnetD Server 4.0 版本的服务器系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0212"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14.190","remediation":"升级 Pragma InterAccess TelnetD Server 至 4.0 以上版本以修复此漏洞；如厂商已停止支持该产品，建议迁移至现代 Telnet/SSH 服务器（如 OpenSSH）。在无法立即升级或迁移的情况下，通过防火墙（如 iptables）限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 Telnet 端口（23/TCP），并使用 TCP Wrappers（hosts.allow/hosts.deny）进行访问控制拦截恶意连接请求，以降低远程拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1001","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4033","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19760","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0212.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0212","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0212.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0212.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m62v-fp25-jhj4/GHSA-m62v-fp25-jhj4.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0212.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001189.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0a9bf5c7-b9b4-44ea-9210-9bcf151b9287.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0172","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0172.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0195","title":"Corel Linux setxconf 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 中的 setxconf 工具存在本地权限提升漏洞。当使用 -T 参数运行时，setxconf 会执行用户指定的 .xserverrc 文件，由于未对文件来源和内容进行安全检查，本地低权限用户可通过创建恶意 .xserverrc 文件并配合 setxconf -T 参数触发该漏洞，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Corel Linux OS 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0195"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-24T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11.990","remediation":"建议立即移除 setxconf 的 setuid 权限：以 root 身份执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/setxconf`，阻止普通用户以 root 权限执行该程序。同时删除不受信任用户的 ~/.xserverrc 文件。由于 Corel Linux 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议迁移至仍受支持的主流 Linux 发行版（如 Ubuntu LTS 或 Debian）以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0323.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1008","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19765","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0195.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0195","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0195.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0195.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f8