m/exploits/19764","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0194.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0194","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0194.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0194.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-58wc-vc65-8m9v/GHSA-58wc-vc65-8m9v.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0194.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a8df9188-433b-4932-8107-b720e82aaa9c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0171.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0194","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0194.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0219","title":"Red Hat Linux 6.0 单用户模式权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.0 的单用户模式身份验证存在安全绕过漏洞。本地攻击者可在系统引导进入单用户模式时，在密码提示符处按下 Ctrl+C 中断验证流程，从而绕过 root 密码认证直接获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.0 版本，攻击者需具备物理或控制台访问权限才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0219"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15.137","remediation":"在 LILO 配置文件 /etc/lilo.conf 中添加 `restricted` 和 `password=密码` 选项，然后运行 `lilo` 重新加载配置；或在 /etc/inittab 中将单用户模式行修改为 `~~:S:wait:/sbin/sulogin` 强制要求密码认证。如无法立即修改，可在 BIOS 设置中禁止从软盘/CDROM 引导并启用引导密码作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1005","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200002230248.NAA19185%40cairo.anu.edu.au","https://kc.mcafee.com/corporate/index?page=content&id=SB10053","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19763","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0219.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0219.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0219","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0219.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0219.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g249-hvwf-7935/GHSA-g249-hvwf-7935.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0219.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/redhat_single_user_mode.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0194.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0194.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0188","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0213","title":"Sambar Server 4.2 Beta 7 CGI 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Sambar Server 4.2 Beta 7 的 CGI 目录下默认包含 ECHO.BAT 和 HELLO.BAT 两个批处理文件，由于未对用户输入进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过向这些 CGI 脚本提交包含 Shell 元字符（如管道符、重定向符等）的特制请求，在服务器端执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Sambar Server 4.2 Beta 7 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致服务器敏感信息泄露或完全受控。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0213"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14.327","remediation":"删除 Sambar Server CGI 目录下的 ECHO.BAT 和 HELLO.BAT 文件，并禁止在 CGI 参数中使用 shell 元字符（如 `|`、`&`、`;`）。建议升级到 4.2 正式版或更高版本（如 5.0+），并在 IIS 反向代理或网络防火墙上限制对 CGI 目录的访问作为临时缓解。若无法升级，考虑迁移至维护中的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx）以彻底规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.sambar.com/session/highlight?url=/syshelp/history.htm&words=security+&color=red","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1002","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38B3E60A.6A84FEC3%40cybcom.net","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19761","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0213.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0213","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0213.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0213.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p8m8-3mxm-p2q7/GHSA-p8m8-3mxm-p2q7.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/sambar_cgi.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0213.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--45a71ecf-aa37-43fe-8414-dc0a69aa44ec.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0188.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0188.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0188.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0160","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0160.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0182","title":"iPlanet Web Server 4.1 HTTP GET 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"iPlanet Web Server 4.1 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标服务器发送大量 HTTP GET 请求，消耗服务器大量内存资源导致系统内核崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响 iPlanet Web Server 4.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，攻击复杂度低且无需特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0182"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10.270","remediation":"升级 iPlanet Web Server 至 4.1 Service Pack 1 或更高版本，该版本已限制单连接最大并发请求数。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或负载均衡设备（如 Apache/Nginx），配置 `limit_req` 模块限制单 IP 请求速率；同时在操作系统层面调整连接跟踪表大小（`net.ipv4.netfilter.ip_conntrack_max`），防止洪泛请求耗尽内核内存触发 panic。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0182","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0182.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0182.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0182","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/f062df8a5412a76a