删除 asmon 和 ascpu 的 setuid 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/X11R6/bin/asmon /usr/X11R6/bin/ascpu），并限制配置文件仅允许 root 用户写入。如无需使用该工具，建议直接卸载软件包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/996","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2092","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19756","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0163.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0163","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0163.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0163.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vp4f-vgc3-pj2r/GHSA-vp4f-vgc3-pj2r.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/996/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0163.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0145.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0145.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0145.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0146","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0146.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0164","title":"Sun Internet Mail Server 密码泄露漏洞","description":"太阳 Internet 邮件服务器（SIMS）在安装过程中会创建全局可读的密码文件，导致本地攻击者可读取该文件获取系统中存储的用户密码凭据。该漏洞允许已获得本地访问权限的攻击者通过简单的文件读取操作窃取凭证，进而提升权限或访问其他用户邮件数据，影响 Sun Internet Mail Server 相关版本。目前厂商已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0164"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-20T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08.017","remediation":"立即检查并限制 SIMS 配置文件（如 /etc/mail/sims.access 等）权限为 600 或 400，仅允许 root 用户读取。同时排查是否存在其他含密码的全局可读文件，并升级到 Sun 官方发布的最新安全补丁版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1004","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=Pine.SOL.4.21.0002200031320.22675-100000%40klayman.hq.formus.pl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0164.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0164","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0164.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0164.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j5f3-8x75-9w2c/GHSA-j5f3-8x75-9w2c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0164.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001179.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/0cfa61c360a1ba2b8737a138d22246739c75af4a/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0146.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0144","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0144.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0162","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer虚拟机文件任意读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft 虚拟机 (Microsoft VM) 在 Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 中存在沙箱逃逸漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱使用户访问恶意网页，利用特制的 Java applet 突破虚拟机安全沙箱限制，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 IE 4.x/5.x 版本，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。攻击者无需身份认证即可触发，但需用户交互（点击恶意链接或访问恶意网站）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0162"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:07.757","remediation":"Microsoft VM 已停止支持，无法通过补丁修复。建议立即卸载 Microsoft VM，并在 Internet Explorer 的 Internet 区域安全设置中将「Java」下的「自定义级别」设为「禁用 Java」。同时升级操作系统至受支持版本，或改用 Edge/Chrome 等现代浏览器。如因遗留系统无法升级，可结合 EMET 或组策略限制 Java Applet 执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-011","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0162.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0162","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0162.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0162.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pc2c-8pxg-2287/GHSA-pc2c-8pxg-2287.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0162.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d98ad802-81b5-480a-839d-a4f8b4b58d75.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001178.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/957/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0144.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0139","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0139.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0155","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 autorun.inf 本地代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 95/98/NT 4.0 的自动运行功能存在权限处理缺陷，本地攻击者可在非可移动介质（如硬盘分区）中放置恶意 autorun.inf 文件，指定替代程序执行的路径。当其他用户访问该驱动器时，系统会以当前用户权限自动执行攻击者预设的恶意程序，导致权限提升或信息泄露。该漏洞利用难度低，影响 Windows 95/98/NT 4.0 多个版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0155"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06.887","remediation":"建议安装 Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a 及后续安全更新。如无法升级，可通过注册表将 `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Policies\\Explorer\\NoDriveTypeAutoRun` 值设为 0xFF 以禁用所有驱动器的自动运行功能，或在组策略中启用\"关闭自动播放\"策略。同时建议升级到不再受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11）以彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/993","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=000701bf79cd%24fdb5a620%244c4342a6%40mightye.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19754","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0155.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0155","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0155.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0155.json","https://github.com/nbrito/research/blob/f070ce78f917d962de8df74cc7a841f1cbbcfa00/cve/CVE-2000-0155/autorun.cpp","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-92rc-5g3w-9vp2/GHSA-92rc-5g3w-9vp2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0155.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0139.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0139.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0139.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0506","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0161","title":"Microsoft Site Server 3.0 Commerce Edition 输入验证漏洞","description":"Microsoft Site Server 3.0 Commerce Edition 提供的示例站点和向导生成的代码存在输入验证漏洞。程序在处理数据库查询时未正确验证用户提交的标识编号参数，导致远程攻击者可通过向该参数注入恶意 SQL 命令，实现对后端数据库的创建、修改、删除或读取操作，严重威胁数据安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0161"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-18","updated":"2026-07-22","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-010 提供的补丁程序，或参考知识库文章 KB252614 对代码进行修改，在数据库查询前对用户输入的标识编号参数进行严格的输入验证和过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:11:01.248458224+00:00","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/994","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-010"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0506.toml"}]